5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m so excited to pick our next big show! I really want to make sure we don’t get blindsided by hidden costs later.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I’d like to understand the actual staffing capacity before we commit to a complex installation.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"The record should speak before we guess. I want to know what actually drew people back, not what looked impressive on paper.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The building itself is a constraint. I need to know what the floor and structure can actually absorb before we promise the space to anyone.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Asuka"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Asuka: The building itself is a constraint. I need to know what the floor and structure can actually absorb before we promise the space to anyone.""}]}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the delivery side. We often approve things in good faith, only to spend the season apologising at the door.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, that makes sense! I’m also worried about where the money goes. Let’s check the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges to see the real numbers.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, I appreciate the focus on costs, but I need to verify who is actually available to execute the work. I will review the conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster composition.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, costs are secondary to attendance. I will examine the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips to see what truly drives return visits.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, I agree on the financials, but I need to verify the physical limits. I will review the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log for powered displays.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I understand your worry about the budget. I will look into the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the loan transport costs to see where we stumble.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’m picking loan transport costs and mount-making charges! I want to see exactly where the budget leaks before we sign anything.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
