35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Oh no, loan transport is nearly a third of installation costs! And mount-making is so expensive per object. We need to be careful!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The lab is down to one person with two hundred pieces waiting. The volunteers are mostly tied up with history walks. We cannot staff a complex show.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The data is clear. Head counts rise where mechanisms run, and visitors return because people are present. Static displays fail.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The bay is capped at four hundred kilos per square metre. Last season, stonework required shoring and a rerouted delivery.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,Two of our last four openings slipped because paperwork arrived after the shipping cut-off. We must plan for those delays.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shion, that’s great! But @Victoria, with only one lab person, how do we handle all the conservation work?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, we don’t. The backlog is already two hundred pieces. Adding a complex show would collapse the lab entirely.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, the data is undeniable. People return for presence and motion, not static cases. We must prioritize that.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, presence is not a substitute for structural integrity. If the bay fails, no one is present. We must respect the weight limit.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, you are right. The weight limit is a hard boundary. I worry the paperwork delays will make any heavy loan impossible to manage safely.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, that’s terrifying! With the lab so backed up, we can’t afford expensive custom mounts either. We need something that arrives ready to go!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, exactly. We lack the hands to build or maintain. We need a show that requires minimal intervention and no powered elements.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, minimal intervention contradicts the data. Motion and presence drive attendance. We cannot ignore the record to save the lab.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, the record is irrelevant if the floor collapses. We cannot install heavy kinetic works in a bay capped at four hundred kilos.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, I hear your passion, but the paperwork delays are a real risk. We cannot promise a show if the crates arrive late.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Shion, I hear you, but we literally cannot afford the custom mounts or the transport! We need something that arrives ready-made to save our budget!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, the data is compelling, but we have no staff to execute it. We must choose a show that fits our current, depleted capacity.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, @Victoria, you are solving for constraints, not the audience. The record demands presence and motion. We must find a way to deliver that, regardless of your logistical fears.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, the floor is not a suggestion. If the structure fails, your motion is irrelevant. We must respect the physical limits before discussing attendance.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, I understand your passion, but the paperwork delays are a real risk. We cannot promise a show if the crates arrive late.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
